For "queen": i=1 ('q'→i=1, 'u' is a vowel), word[0]=='q' && word[1]=='u' → i=2 → "eenquay". Correct.

So the qu check is: if i > 0 && word[i-1] == 'q' && word[i] == 'u' { i++ }.

